OL,3,GNEWSAFormer owner of famous
OL,4,Acock-on-a-stick stall dies
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe man who used to owned the legendary
OL,7,Fcock-on-a-stick stall at Nottingham's
OL,8,FGoose Fair has died.
OL,10,FRay Brooks, who worked at the stall for
OL,11,Fmore than 70 years, died aged 95 at the
OL,12,FQueen's Medical Centre in Nottingham on
OL,13,FWednesday after a fall at home.
OL,15,FHis son Robin Brooks said he was happy
OL,16,Fto know his father's legacy would
OL,17,Fcontinue through the stall, which has
OL,18,Fbeen at the Goose Fair for more than
OL,19,F100 years.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
