OL,3,GNEWSAFormer owner of famous
OL,4,Acock-on-a-stick stall dies
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said the stall, which sells the
OL,7,Fcockerel-shaped treats, had given him
OL,8,Fand his father "lots of fun and lots of
OL,9,Flaughs".
